      "id": "claim_fdfc1d2244134e45a6a2875bf32fd797",
      "statement": "Investigation GC runs on its own EventBridge schedule and filters managed, identifier-validated, path-matched EFS access points. It initially matches RUNNING tasks from a tag-based cluster snapshot; with no match, strict creation age beyond GRACE_PERIOD_HOURS or missing/empty CreatedAt makes the investigation stale, while invalid present timestamps are errors. A final deterministic startedBy query must find no running task before cleanup.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy/regional/lambda-reap-investigations.tf#L216-L239",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2ef2b8b375349019257f4162caa9dd7bca79d0bfebfbeaaecec828054bdfd92b:"
