      "id": "claim_99ec1fde04d247dda4dc52b117ec9808",
      "statement": "Create-investigation writes the access point's CreatedAt tag when creating it, but reuse neither refreshes nor backfills it; restarting or stopping a task therefore does not reset the investigation's creation-age threshold or remove the missing-tag legacy condition.",
